# Build context for backend/Dockerfile: only what the image needs (pyproject, lockfile, README, src).
# Everything else stays out so no secret or local state can end up in a layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!src/
!src/**

# Even inside src/: no caches, no bytecode.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
